        "TileImage": "$($repository 53c1bee8-289a-498b-8b09-1167a981fd5c).Image",
        "Description": "Recently, a client got in contact with us following out recon mission of Whittelton Creek. Somehow, a low ranking government official figured out the scouts&apos; true identity and has contacted us. They want certain people with problematic personalities eliminated. It seems our client has a flair for the dramatic, and hopes each target can be elimated in an ironic sense, possibly to deter other loud personalities. Our client has asked that non-targets are left unharmed.",
